{
  "name": "dsh-tavern",
  "version": "2.6.42",
  "description": "酒館模式：一間酒館＝一個你選的資料夾。新增時在裡面建立人物卡／世界書／對話／設定的結構，UI 只讀寫這些檔案",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "itdogwowo",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./agent": "./lib/agent.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "lib/agent.js",
    "lib/registry.js",
    "lib/workspace.js",
    "lib/assets.js",
    "lib/roomfiles.js",
    "lib/pngcard.js",
    "lib/write.js",
    "lib/defaults.js",
    "lib/preset.js",
    "lib/theme.js",
    "lib/worldbook.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "dsh.plugin.json",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "verify": "node verify.mjs",
    "test": "node verify.mjs && node test-pngcard.mjs && node test-worldbook.mjs && node test-agent.mjs && node test-preset.mjs && node smoke.mjs && node test-workspace.mjs && node test-registry.mjs && node test-client.mjs"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "tavern",
    "sillytavern",
    "character-card",
    "worldbook",
    "酒館"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/itdogwowo/dsh-tavern.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/itdogwowo/dsh-tavern/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/itdogwowo/dsh-tavern#readme",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "external": [
        "react"
      ]
    }
  },
  "comment": "兩個硬規則。(1) 零執行期依賴：DSH 的 loader 啟動時同步導入 loader entry，任何頂層 import 解析失敗整個 dsh web 就起不來，所以宿主半只 import node: 與相對檔案（DSH discussion #1884）；verify.mjs 會強制檢查。(2) 宿主半只依賴 webServer 一個服務：不碰 settings／agent／systemPrompt，因為那些都要在啟動時跟核心服務打交道，任何一個卡住就會讓 DSH 開不起來（macOS 上發生過）。",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  }
}
